(7670974, 1252488, 30049, '<td valign="top">Voter earlier.  Coming back around to comment. My top pick.  This is quite the curiosity.  Hope there''s some photographer''s comments on this to read when the challenge wraps up.  I''m interested to learn what the yellow material is.  Love the title BTW.  :-)</td>', 'Voter earlier.  Coming back around to comment. My top pick.  This is quite the curiosity.  Hope there''s some photographer''s comments on this to read when the challenge wraps up.  I''m interested to learn what the yellow material is.  Love the title BTW.  :-)', '2020-07-28 12:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7670975, 1252175, 30049, '<td valign="top">Voter earlier.  Coming back around to comment.   I like this.  Thinking that this is a shop / store display?  Works for the challenge though.  Good luck.</td>', 'Voter earlier.  Coming back around to comment.   I like this.  Thinking that this is a shop / store display?  Works for the challenge though.  Good luck.', '2020-07-28 12:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
