(7671073, 1252433, 114285, '<td valign="top">What an amazing shot of ordinary buses!<br/> <br/>Just as well theyre parked on an angle, thats what really makes this artistic. Good find, good find. My pick for a ribbon.</td>', 'What an amazing shot of ordinary buses! Just as well theyre parked on an angle, thats what really makes this artistic. Good find, good find. My pick for a ribbon.', '2020-07-29 08:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
