(7671132, 1252475, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like that the dog is inattentive to us, very much keeping his eyes and ears pointed toward his charges, while keeping us in the periphery of his view. His front is slightly raised as if he is poised to get up at any minute; there''s a tension there.</td>', 'I like that the dog is inattentive to us, very much keeping his eyes and ears pointed toward his charges, while keeping us in the periphery of his view. His front is slightly raised as if he is poised to get up at any minute; there''s a tension there.', '2020-07-30 10:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
