(7671878, 1252452, 56502, '<td valign="top">I can''t say, why the shot didn''t appeal to the voters, maybe they didn''t appreciate the neatness of a swiss town. <br/> <br/>But independent from the challenge - I think it is a real cool shot. The glaring sun, the long shadows, the two women in the otherwise empty narrow street. It has a very special feel to it, underlined by the black and white.<br/> <br/>Nothing wasted here from your side, as far as I''m concerned.</td>', 'I can''t say, why the shot didn''t appeal to the voters, maybe they didn''t appreciate the neatness of a swiss town.  But independent from the challenge - I think it is a real cool shot. The glaring sun, the long shadows, the two women in the otherwise empty narrow street. It has a very special feel to it, underlined by the black and white. Nothing wasted here from your side, as far as I''m concerned.', '2020-08-08 17:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
